      "message": "since this is repeated, you can generalize this into a function and call it like `metadata.title \u003d get_from_variant(variant, \"PlayerMetadata::Title\")`\n\nand you can define such helper function like:\n```\nfn get_from_variant\u003cT: Default + RefArgToRust\u003cRustType \u003d T\u003e\u003e(\n    variant: \u0026dbus::arg::Variant\u003cBox\u003cdyn RefArg\u003e\u003e,\n    field_name: \u0026str,\n) -\u003e T {\n    T::ref_arg_to_rust(variant.as_static_inner(0).unwrap(), String::from(field_name))\n        .unwrap_or(T::default())\n}\n```",
